# Review sweep chunk C (2026-11-09): the review's coverage gaps G1-G25
# verified against the post-chunk-B / post-R4 tree. Classes below pin
# the gaps that were real; gaps already covered by then are named in
# the sweep ledger (code-forge-review-sweep-ledger-2026-11-09.md).
